{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪公演、早いねー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう明日千秋楽だって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/06/02/%E3%81%82%E3%81%BF.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみが大阪公演でやった役は..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日に明田川太郎。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の昼公演に乃木芙咲子。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜公演に北嶋文目。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれもありがたい事に立候補した役をやらせてもらってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日にかんしては、東京公演の千秋楽のぶんをどうしてもリベンジしたかったので嬉しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ちた役を落ちたままにしたくないんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日の昼公演のふさこ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始めて三姉妹に挑戦したからかなり緊張したんだが、あのドレスを着れて良かったな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/06/02/0019440/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんてたって久々の黒髪ロングヘアーにテンション上がりましたよ能條(｀_´)ゞふんふん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜公演の北嶋、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北嶋は東京公演で一度やらせてもらった時すっごく楽しくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対大阪公演でもっかいやってやる！って思ってたの(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金に目がくらみすぎのずる賢い女、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......素で演じる事が出来ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うっそーーん❤❤❤❤❤❤❤❤笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TEHEPEROPUNPUNMARU。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今隣でちーちゃんがあみの肩によっかかりながら寝てます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの大きい目を閉じてね＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のホテルの同室はおなじみ齋藤飛鳥。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アメリカ風の名前をつけるとしたら......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「テレサ ゴメス」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな彼女とこの3日間でより距離を縮められたらいいなと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オモウヨ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真撮ってみたんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/06/02/0019440/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワタシタチナカヨシデース。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の千秋楽、昼の部冒険出ます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜の部...どうしましょうか。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうとにかくどうなるかわからないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はひたすら演技を楽しみます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台っていう素敵な生もの、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"梅田芸術劇場で、舞う。。。ぐふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し遅くなった告知ー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日から発売のブブカに能條がのっかってます(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"病み上がりだったのでなんだか刀みたいな顔してるけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい語ったんで観ていただけたら嬉しいな❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/06/02/0019440/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近覚えた敬礼ポーズ。笑"}],"source":"archive"}